如果 cron 段表示频率，则可能包含以下特殊字符之一：`*`，`/`或`?`。`*`字符表示该字段的所有可能值，而`/`和`?`用于指定频率。以下是如何处理表示频率的 cron 段的示例： 

```
public static int[] getFieldAsInts(String field) throws Exception {
        // The field may contain a list of integers, ranges or frequency values
        // Split the field by comma to get the individual elements
        String[] elements = field.split(",");
        // Initialize a list to store the integers
        List<Integer> ints = new ArrayList<>();
        // Iterate over the elements
        for (String element : elements) {
            if (element.equals("*")) {
                // it represents all values so return all possible values 
                ints.addAll(getAllValues());
            } else if (element.contains("-")) {
                // Split the range by hyphen to get the start and end of the range
                String[] range = element.split("-");
                // Get the start and end of the range as integers
                int start = Integer.parseInt(range[0]);
                int end = Integer.parseInt(range[1]);
                // Add the integers in the range to the list
                for (int i = start; i <= end; i++) {
                    ints.add(i);
                }
            } else if (element.contains("/")) {
                // element represents a frequency
                // split the element by "/" and get the frequency
                String[] frequency = element.split("/");
                int frequenceVal = Integer.parseInt(frequency[1]);
                ints.addAll(getFrequencyValues(frequenceVal));
            } else {
                // The element is not a range, it should be an integer
                ints.add(Integer.parseInt(element));
            }
        }
        // Convert the list to an array
        return ints.stream().mapToInt(Integer::intValue).toArray();
